{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>They wandered in the way</b> — joined with 'they wandered,' and they are the redeemed of HaShem; He will tell what happened to them." "<b>A wilderness</b> — I have explained it."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 107, :notes {0 "Resolved the bare prefix דבק ('joined') as referring to the grammatical attachment of the phrase 'in the way' to the verb תעו.", 1 "Cross-reference to his earlier comment; no expansion supplied."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:53.901585443Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}